foreign  welcome to another installment of Harry  Potter Theory today we're discussing the  upcoming Harry Potter game Hogwarts  Legacy just recently we were finally  given a definitive release date for the  game February 10 2023 and it seems like  since this announcement was made bought  key games have been rolling out update  after update we were in the dark for so  long and now there's so much to cover I  haven't been covering the game much so  far but rest assured I will be covering  it moving forward today I'm going to be  discussing some new details released in  the game's updated FAQ I'm only going to  be discussing the new information so if  you want the old staff then be sure to  check out my old FAQ video which I'll  link below let's get into it 1. when  will Hogwarts Legacy be available  Hogwarts Legacy will launch on February  10 2023 for Playstation Xbox and PC the  Nintendo switch launch date will be  revealed soon  2. can players choose their Hogwarts  house in Hogwarts Legacy players can  choose their Hogwarts house at the start  of Hogwarts Legacy 3. can players link  their Harry Potter fan club account with  their WB Games account to import their  house in one and two Hogwarts Legacy yes  based on the Harry Potter fan club's  official sorting experience together  with the one ceremony players can bring  their authentic self into the game  linking accounts will also unlock a  beaked skull mask and exclusive house  fanatic robes in game a special set of  house-themed robes so players can  represent their Hogwarts house with  style 4. can players customize their  character in Hogwarts Legacy players can  create the witch or wizard they want to  be in Hogwarts Legacy they can customize  their character the onset of their  Adventure as they progress they'll also  be able to develop their own special  combat style  5. will players establish friendships in  Hogwarts Legacy some students at  Hogwarts will become friends as players  grow these relationships these  schoolmates will become companions who  can accompany players on their Journey  expand their abilities and open up as  players learn their stories 6. will  there be official Hogwarts Legacy  companion books Insight editions is  publishing the art and making of  hogwart's legacy and Scholastic Inc is  publishing Hogwarts Legacy the official  game guide  7. will you see Harry Potter Hermione  Granger or Ron Weasley in the game no  Hogwarts Legacy is set in the 1800s  before the time period of JK Rowling's  Original Stories 8. what are the  dangerous threats in Hogwarts Legacy The  Wizarding World is fought for dangers  including creatures corrupted by Magical  Force Sinister witches and wizards as  well as a possible mounting Goblin  Rebellion 9. does Hogwarts Legacy have a  morality system Hogwarts Legacy does not  have a morality system but players will  encounter various quests and storylines  that will influence the witch or wizard  they choose to become 10. is Hogwarts  Castle explorable in Hogwarts Legacy yes  players will be able to explore a fully  realized Hogwarts Castle where they will  attend classes discover dungeons secret  passageways and challenging puzzles 11.  is quidditch playable in Hogwarts Legacy  Greenwich is not not playable in  Hogwarts Legacy however broom flight for  traversal and to broom race challenges  are part of the game players can also  fly rooms to explore new and familiar  locations surrounding Hogwarts Castle  12. can players ride magical beasts in  Hogwarts Legacy plans can tame Mountain  ride some magical beasts in Hogwarts  Legacy 13. what kinds of classes will  players attend in Hogwarts Legacy  players will attend classes such as  charms defense against the dark arts  herbology and potions where they will  meet their professors learn Dakar spells  grow magical plants brew potions and  more 14. how do players level up in  Hogwarts Legacy in addition to classes  and spells players will have access to a  deep set of upgrades talents and skills  to Aid their progression as a witch or  wizard they can complete challenges  throughout the world to earn experience  and level up their abilities magical  gear can also be upgraded and  specialized to increase offensive and  defensive capabilities in a chosen play  style 15. can players mix and match  spells in Hogwarts Legacy mixing and  matching dozens of spells in Hogwarts  Legacy will let players Define their  combat Style on the path to become the  ultimate duelist 16. what is the room of  requirement the room of requirement is  an important secret of Hogwarts that  helps players customize and grow their  abilities we'll have more details to  share at a later time 17. is there  console exclusive content in Hogwarts  Legacy the haunted hogsmead shop Quest  an eerie mystery Adventure involving  hogsmead shopkeeper Madame Mason will be  available only for PlayStation 5 and  Playstation 4 versions of Hogwarts  Legacy players who complete the haunted  hogsmeade drop Quest and Associated  dungeon will also get exclusive access  to their own shop in hogsmead where they  can sell items in gear at rates better  than anywhere else in game 18. does  Hogwarts Legacy have online or co-op  gameplay Hogwarts Legacy is a single  player experience and does not have  online or co-op gameplay 19. does  Hogwarts Legacy require an internet  connection those who purchase a physical  copy of Hogwarts Legacy will be required  to connect to the internet to install a  day one patch those who purchase the  game digitally will receive the patch  with the initial download  20. will Hogwarts Legacy include  accessibility features Hogwarts Legacy  will include accessibility features  we'll have more details to share at a  later time 21. will Hogwarts Legacy  adhere to Wizarding World law yes while  Hogwarts Legacy is not a direct  adaptation of the books and films the  games are anchored in Wizarding World  lore Avalanche is creating a unique  gaming experience that is inspired by  the magical universe created by JK  Rowling in which players will find new  and unexpected locations characters and  story elements 22. does the game take  place only in Hogwarts Castle Hogwarts  Legacy takes players Beyond Hogwarts to  new and familiar locations including the  Forbidden Forest and hogsmead Village  23. what does Porky mean and why have  you chosen it for this label in the  Harry Potter series a port key is an  object Enchanted to instantly transport  anyone touching it to a specific  location most of the time a port key is  an everyday object that would not draw  the attention of a muggle for portkey  games it symbolizes how games under this  label will transport fans to their own  Adventures inspired by The Wizarding  World  24. our portkey games created with JK  Rowling's approval each experience  offered under Porky games will take  place in The Wizarding World and will be  authentic to it JK Rowling has entrusted  the design and creation of the games to  Warner Bros games and the developers  involved who are collaborating with our  team on all aspects of the games 25.  what is JK Rowling's involvement with  the game is this a new story from JK  Rowling JK Rowling is not involved in  the creation of the game but as creator  of The Wizarding World and one of the  world's greatest storytellers her  extraordinary body of writing is the  foundation of all projects in The  Wizarding World this is not a new story  from JK rolling however we have  collaborated closely with her team on  all aspects of the game to ensure it  remains in line with the magical  experiences fans expect and that's it  for this video I hope you learned  something from this updated game FAQ  stay tuned for more updates in the game  and be sure to subscribe to the channel  to get notified about future videos  until next time remember it does not do  to dwell on dreams and forget to live  [Music]  [Music]

